1
00:01:05,247 --> 00:01:08,387
[Episode 1]

2
00:01:17,431 --> 00:01:20,640
My goodness, what a crowd!

3
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:22,400
- Yes.
- Gentlemen,

4
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:25,040
Bao Zhu of the Jin's Butcher Shop

5
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,480
is the most capable girl

6
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:29,120
[Sai Jin Hua, Matchmaker of Lianhua Township]
for miles around!

7
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,239
Really?

8
00:01:30,239 --> 00:01:32,599
She is gorgeous,

9
00:01:32,599 --> 00:01:37,140
and best of all, gentle and caring.

10
00:01:54,159 --> 00:01:55,959
You have all seen it, haven't you?

11
00:01:55,959 --> 00:01:58,120
Look at her build, and her strength.

12
00:01:58,120 --> 00:02:00,812
She could easily pop out a dozen sons

13
00:02:00,812 --> 00:02:02,400
without breaking a sweat!

14
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:04,400
Now that her father's mourning is done,

15
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:06,840
her mother asked me to play matchmaker.

16
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:09,199
That's how you lads got so lucky.

17
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:12,879
She is considerate
and doesn't want to waste anyone's time,

18
00:02:12,879 --> 00:02:14,199
so she had me

19
00:02:14,199 --> 00:02:16,479
gather you all here to size each other up.

20
00:02:16,479 --> 00:02:18,680
You'd all better impress today.

21
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:22,120
Don't miss this fine match!

22
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,780
- Me first!
- Line up!

23
00:02:24,719 --> 00:02:26,340
Line up, all of you.

24
00:02:47,906 --> 00:02:51,628
[Jin Bao Zhu, Daughter of a Butcher]

25
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:55,000
I sell vegetables.

26
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:58,080
It's just me and my mother. No land.

27
00:02:58,080 --> 00:03:00,479
I make my living
from calligraphy and paintings.

28
00:03:00,479 --> 00:03:02,439
My four older sisters live with me

29
00:03:02,439 --> 00:03:04,000
and take care of the household.

30
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:06,280
Killing harms your karma and lacks decency.

31
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:09,280
Miss Bao Zhu, I'm a blacksmith.

32
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,400
I make decent money.

33
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:12,280
You butcher pigs, and I forge iron.

34
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:14,680
Together, we can conquer anything.

35
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:17,159
The elderly have weak teeth
and slow digestion.

36
00:03:17,159 --> 00:03:19,039
Once stewed, the layered pork belly

37
00:03:19,039 --> 00:03:20,599
won't stick in teeth.

38
00:03:20,599 --> 00:03:22,939
That's 57 wen and 6 fen.

39
00:03:23,879 --> 00:03:26,960
Pig's heart enriches blood,
and liver sharpens vision.

40
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:29,360
They're perfect for soup
to boost qi and kidneys.

41
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:31,800
That's 50 wen and 4 fen.

42
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:32,800
No, no, no!

43
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,800
You don't even care for your sisters.

44
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:37,199
How can I expect you to care for your wife

45
00:03:37,199 --> 00:03:39,680
and teach her to read and write?

46
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:41,719
This trotter is perfect for you.

47
00:03:41,719 --> 00:03:44,599
Blacksmithing ruins your hands.
Eat what you want to heal!

48
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:47,479
- That's 64 wen and 8 fen.
- So pricey?

49
00:03:47,479 --> 00:03:49,479
If you're this stingy with yourself,

50
00:03:49,479 --> 00:03:51,460
how can you afford a beauty?

51
00:04:17,279 --> 00:04:19,399
Here I am talking up matches for you,

52
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:22,759
and you're just bleeding them dry like pigs.

53
00:04:22,759 --> 00:04:26,079
If word gets out, you'll ruin my reputation.

54
00:04:26,079 --> 00:04:28,439
I appreciate your kindness, ma'am,

55
00:04:28,439 --> 00:04:30,279
but marriage is no joke.

56
00:04:30,279 --> 00:04:32,079
If I rush into a bad match,

57
00:04:32,079 --> 00:04:34,160
that would really ruin your reputation.

58
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:36,319
Your mother's dying to get your bride price.

59
00:04:36,319 --> 00:04:37,879
If you stall any longer,

60
00:04:37,879 --> 00:04:40,399
she'll tie you up
and marry you to a rich landlord.

61
00:04:40,399 --> 00:04:43,279
I'll marry. Of course, I will.

62
00:04:43,279 --> 00:04:45,839
But only to the best.

63
00:04:45,839 --> 00:04:48,637
I want him handsome,

64
00:04:48,637 --> 00:04:51,480
tall, healthy,

65
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:54,959
well-off, and of noble character,

66
00:04:54,959 --> 00:04:57,480
a man who excels both indoors and out,

67
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:59,519
handling both home and the world.

68
00:04:59,519 --> 00:05:01,480
[Xie Yan, Courtesy Name Cheng Jiang,
Eldest Legitimate Son of the Xie Family]

69
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:05,620
Master, this is the Huang family's
returned betrothal card.

70
00:05:07,248 --> 00:05:08,360
[Betrothal Card]

71
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:11,279
He must respect me, understand me,
and accommodate me.

72
00:05:11,279 --> 00:05:13,800
He can never pick fights or bully others.

73
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:16,600
Stop. You take me for the wishing turtle
at the temple?

74
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:19,639
That turtle there
takes money but does nothing.

75
00:05:19,639 --> 00:05:22,420
Not like you.
You've got good looks and a good heart.

76
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:28,319
Fine, I'll find you some rich fools
with money to burn.

77
00:05:28,319 --> 00:05:29,819
Very well.

78
00:05:44,959 --> 00:05:47,073
Dinner's ready!

79
00:05:47,073 --> 00:05:49,392
[Zhao Hai Tang, Concubine of the Jin Family]

80
00:05:49,392 --> 00:05:50,399
[Huang Li Rong, Wife of the Jin Family]

81
00:05:50,399 --> 00:05:53,560
Bao Zhu, is Yu's egg custard ready?

82
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:55,360
[Jin Bao Yu, Legitimate Son of the Jins]
It's ready.

83
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:57,139
Come on, Bao Yu. Sit.

84
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,959
Didn't I say no sesame seeds?

85
00:06:07,959 --> 00:06:09,600
It hurts my teeth.

86
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,920
Stop whining.

87
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:12,540
If you won't eat it, give it to my mama.

88
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:15,639
Hai Tang is sick. Eggs are hard to digest.

89
00:06:15,639 --> 00:06:17,639
She should eat light.

90
00:06:17,639 --> 00:06:19,879
Yu don't eat the sesame,

91
00:06:19,879 --> 00:06:22,240
so just pick them out for him.

92
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:24,279
I cooked the dinner,
and now I have to pick the sesame too?

93
00:06:24,279 --> 00:06:25,720
How about he eat some leftovers?

94
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,120
Outrageous!

95
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,480
Such vulgar talk!

96
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:29,639
Fine, don't pick them out.

97
00:06:29,639 --> 00:06:31,120
We still need to eat.

98
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:34,680
Mama, you can have it.

99
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:37,040
Bao Zhu, studying strains Yu's eyes,

100
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,240
and my eyesight's failing.

101
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:40,079
So I asked for your help.

102
00:06:40,079 --> 00:06:43,279
Since my husband passed,
you've shouldered the family burden.

103
00:06:43,279 --> 00:06:45,240
But once Yu succeeds,

104
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:47,720
you two will enjoy the good life through us.

105
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:50,300
Isn't that right?

106
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,879
You're right, Li Rong.

107
00:07:01,879 --> 00:07:06,100
The Jin family's future depends on Yu.

108
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,920
I'll pick out the part with the sesame.

109
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:13,879
Here, you eat the part with sesame.

110
00:07:13,879 --> 00:07:16,160
Yu, you can have the rest.

111
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:18,100
- Here.
- You treat me the best after all.

112
00:07:19,879 --> 00:07:21,379
Eat up, Yu.

113
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:33,000
Yu studies harder than anyone else,

114
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,839
yet he never passes the exams.

115
00:07:34,839 --> 00:07:38,360
He was a fusheng scholar
in last year's Academy Exam.

116
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:41,199
He told me in private

117
00:07:41,199 --> 00:07:43,763
that the rich candidates
pulled strings early on

118
00:07:43,763 --> 00:07:45,360
and bought the exam questions.

119
00:07:45,360 --> 00:07:47,800
I know full well

120
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:50,000
that if Yu can pull it off,

121
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:53,360
Bao Zhu is sure to marry well.

122
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:57,920
It's just that
I really don't have any money right now.

123
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:59,420
Hai Tang.

124
00:08:01,319 --> 00:08:03,160
Have you heard of the Bai family?

125
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:06,639
They made a fortune in canal shipping.

126
00:08:06,639 --> 00:08:09,839
A relative of theirs is Yu's classmate.

127
00:08:09,839 --> 00:08:12,639
Hearing Bao Zhu's mourning period is over,

128
00:08:12,639 --> 00:08:15,939
he asked Yu to test the waters.

129
00:08:17,079 --> 00:08:18,720
That won't do.

130
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:20,879
Even if Bao Zhu marries,

131
00:08:20,879 --> 00:08:23,800
she must choose a man she likes.

132
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:26,480
Besides, they are a powerful clan,

133
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:29,079
while we have neither power or money.

134
00:08:29,079 --> 00:08:33,639
Even if Bao Zhu married in, she'd probably
get pushed around left and right.

135
00:08:33,639 --> 00:08:36,720
Bao Zhu loves money most,

136
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:39,120
and the Bais have plenty of it.

137
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:41,480
A few scraps from their table

138
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:44,399
could support us for three years.

139
00:08:44,399 --> 00:08:46,320
Yu can take his exams with that money,

140
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:50,759
and once he passes,
your daughter will be an official's sister.

141
00:08:50,759 --> 00:08:52,960
Then our family will be nobility.

142
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:57,259
However powerful the Bais are,
would they dare wrong an official's daughter?

143
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:02,360
This is the Bai family's betrothal agreement.

144
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:03,639
I've already signed it.

145
00:09:03,639 --> 00:09:06,000
It just needs your fingerprint as her mama,

146
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:08,940
and it will be settled.

147
00:09:16,352 --> 00:09:20,240
Hai Tang, what are you hesitating for?

148
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:24,980
Opportunity only knocks once.

149
00:09:26,799 --> 00:09:29,159
No, absolutely not.

150
00:09:29,159 --> 00:09:32,840
I have to talk it over with Bao Zhu tomorrow.

151
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:36,019
Anyway, I still have to give her a heads-up.

152
00:10:03,559 --> 00:10:05,320
Bao Zhu,

153
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:07,500
be honest with me.

154
00:10:08,679 --> 00:10:12,559
Out of all those men,
did you really not fancy a single one?

155
00:10:12,559 --> 00:10:15,879
Mama, are you really that eager
to marry me off?

156
00:10:15,879 --> 00:10:17,480
Of course, I'm not.

157
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:21,879
I was just born unlucky into poverty

158
00:10:21,879 --> 00:10:23,899
and sold as a concubine.

159
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:27,360
Suffering myself is one thing,

160
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:30,580
but now I can't even protect you.

161
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:33,559
I just want you to marry well

162
00:10:33,559 --> 00:10:36,620
so you won't suffer from poverty anymore.

163
00:10:45,493 --> 00:10:50,379
Mama, I have money. I can protect you.

164
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,559
Look.

165
00:10:57,559 --> 00:10:58,679
[Fifty-Four Taels of Silver]
Actually,

166
00:10:58,679 --> 00:11:00,879
I set my sights on a house a long time ago.

167
00:11:00,879 --> 00:11:03,679
It's a bit remote and the rooms are small,

168
00:11:03,679 --> 00:11:05,720
but at least it's a place of our own.

169
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:07,080
Give me a few more years.

170
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:10,120
Once I save enough, we'll quietly move there.

171
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:12,799
After we move,
we'll have egg custard every day,

172
00:11:12,799 --> 00:11:15,200
with dried whitebait,

173
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:17,220
shrimp, and sesame oil.

174
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,460
Mama...

175
00:11:37,519 --> 00:11:39,080
Rest up, Li Rong.

176
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:40,940
I'm going back to my room.

177
00:11:43,879 --> 00:11:47,460
Also, is it true
she's been skimming off the top

178
00:11:48,519 --> 00:11:50,139
behind our back?

179
00:11:50,799 --> 00:11:52,600
What are you saying?

180
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:55,399
Ms. Sai came to arrange matches for Bao Zhu,

181
00:11:55,399 --> 00:11:58,440
only to be dragged into the pen to buy meat,

182
00:11:58,440 --> 00:12:00,039
making her a fortune.

183
00:12:00,039 --> 00:12:01,679
She made the trip for nothing,

184
00:12:01,679 --> 00:12:03,799
and only got a pittance.

185
00:12:03,799 --> 00:12:06,399
Naturally, she had doubts.

186
00:12:06,399 --> 00:12:09,720
Before leaving, she kept an eye out

187
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:11,519
glanced at the door

188
00:12:11,519 --> 00:12:16,480
and happened to see Bao Zhu
stuffing cash into the soles of her shoes.

189
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:19,399
I raised Bao Zhu myself.

190
00:12:19,399 --> 00:12:21,580
She would never do such a thing.

191
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:32,679
From now on, you must act with integrity.

192
00:12:32,679 --> 00:12:34,120
Do you understand?

193
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:35,919
Alright, Hai Tang.

194
00:12:35,919 --> 00:12:38,879
I think Bao Zhu knows she was wrong.

195
00:12:38,879 --> 00:12:40,480
I did nothing wrong!

196
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:43,279
Yes, you did nothing wrong.

197
00:12:43,279 --> 00:12:45,879
You act with integrity

198
00:12:45,879 --> 00:12:48,200
and never betray your own.

199
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,799
I was wrong.

200
00:12:49,799 --> 00:12:51,879
It was all my fault.

201
00:12:51,879 --> 00:12:53,580
I was too soft

202
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:56,500
and spoiled her rotten!

203
00:12:57,279 --> 00:12:58,480
I failed the Jin family!

204
00:12:58,480 --> 00:13:02,368
Mama, you're not soft-hearted!
You're just foolish!

205
00:13:02,368 --> 00:13:05,899
Hey! How dare you talk back!

206
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:11,039
Displeasing parents
makes one unfit to be human.

207
00:13:11,039 --> 00:13:13,799
Disobeying them
makes one unfit to be a child.

208
00:13:13,799 --> 00:13:15,559
You dare insult your own mother?

209
00:13:15,559 --> 00:13:17,039
Are you even human?

210
00:13:17,039 --> 00:13:18,679
Have you no shame, you wretch?

211
00:13:18,679 --> 00:13:20,279
Me, a wretch?

212
00:13:20,279 --> 00:13:22,200
Then you are the lowest wretch.

213
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:25,240
Yu hangs at the waist, Zhu sits on the crown!
(*Yu means jade; Zhu means pearl)

214
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:27,820
I will always stand above you!

215
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:31,399
What kind of "Zhu" can sit on a crown?

216
00:13:31,399 --> 00:13:34,720
You illiterate fool, all these years,

217
00:13:34,720 --> 00:13:36,360
don't you know the "Zhu" in your name

218
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:37,840
means a pig to be slaughtered?

219
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:40,679
- Then you're worse than a slaughtered pig!
- Bao Zhu!

220
00:13:40,679 --> 00:13:42,000
If I am a wretch,

221
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:43,559
you are lower than a wretch,

222
00:13:43,559 --> 00:13:45,000
- the most pathetic wretch!
- Enough!

223
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:46,799
How dare you still talk back?

224
00:13:46,799 --> 00:13:48,879
You'd even pocket an egg.

225
00:13:48,879 --> 00:13:51,580
Everyone knows you skim every pig deal.

226
00:13:54,399 --> 00:13:56,200
If I hadn't pushed you so hard,

227
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:58,159
[Fifty-Four Taels of Silver]
it wouldn't have been easy to get this money.

228
00:13:58,159 --> 00:13:59,440
Fools are hateful.

229
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:01,600
Those unaware of their folly are pathetic!

230
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:03,720
In the end, you still have to rely on us.

231
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:05,220
Hand over the money!

232
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:11,580
I took the beating.

233
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:15,279
Want the money? Not a chance!

234
00:14:15,279 --> 00:14:17,000
You can afford to study

235
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:19,519
only because I butcher and sell pigs
every day.

236
00:14:19,519 --> 00:14:20,960
I earned this myself,

237
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:22,519
so why should I give it to you?

238
00:14:22,519 --> 00:14:24,400
I'm telling you, this is my money!

239
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:25,480
- It's mine!
- Bao Zhu!

240
00:14:25,480 --> 00:14:26,919
Hai Tang, rein this wild girl!

241
00:14:26,919 --> 00:14:29,200
I won't give it to you! It's mine!

242
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:30,779
Enough!

243
00:14:38,919 --> 00:14:40,419
Mama.

244
00:14:41,080 --> 00:14:42,620
Give it to me.

245
00:14:45,759 --> 00:14:47,759
Give the money to Yu,

246
00:14:47,759 --> 00:14:49,679
so he can buy connections.

247
00:14:49,679 --> 00:14:53,139
You'll only have a good life if he succeeds.

248
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:57,620
Give it to me.

249
00:14:59,600 --> 00:15:01,259
Give it here!

250
00:15:16,559 --> 00:15:18,399
Concubine Zhao!

251
00:15:18,399 --> 00:15:19,480
- Come on, let's get the money.
- Hai Tang,

252
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:22,224
- it had to be you.
- Let's get the money.

253
00:15:22,224 --> 00:15:23,480
Let's go.

254
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,980
Slow down.

255
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:58,480
Didn't you always want to be a grand lady?

256
00:15:58,480 --> 00:16:02,320
Go on, the Xie family's bridal sedan
is waiting at the village entrance,

257
00:16:02,320 --> 00:16:03,840
ready for you.

258
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:04,840
What do you know?

259
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:07,759
That sedan's meant
for the Xie family's sickly son's bride.

260
00:16:07,759 --> 00:16:10,519
Ghost carriers send you
to the Underworld, you in?

261
00:16:10,519 --> 00:16:11,679
Cut the crap.

262
00:16:11,679 --> 00:16:13,360
He's the legitimate son of the Xie family.

263
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:16,860
When he kicks the bucket,
all the money will be yours.

264
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:21,200
Here's yours.

265
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:24,279
The son of the Director
of the Canal Shipping Bureau

266
00:16:24,279 --> 00:16:27,279
topped the provincial examination!
Let all rejoice with him!

267
00:16:27,279 --> 00:16:29,000
Congratulations!

268
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:31,840
The son of the Director
of the Canal Shipping Bureau

269
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:35,379
topped the provincial examination!
Let all rejoice with him!

270
00:16:36,679 --> 00:16:39,679
The son of the Director
of the Canal Shipping Bureau

271
00:16:39,679 --> 00:16:42,000
topped the provincial examination!

272
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:43,759
That consumptive jinxes women.

273
00:16:43,759 --> 00:16:44,960
Didn't you know?

274
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,840
He's a paralytic too.

275
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:49,639
The Huangs burned every bridge
to tear up the engagement.

276
00:16:49,639 --> 00:16:52,139
No wonder they're here for a woman.

277
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:16,359
- So much money!
- Yes.

278
00:17:16,359 --> 00:17:18,660
- Shiny silver ingots!
- Enough to last us quite a while.

279
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:31,539
Are you insane? Why dress like that?

280
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:36,539
- Yu.
- Bao Zhu.

281
00:17:37,559 --> 00:17:39,059
Where are you going?

282
00:18:02,079 --> 00:18:03,480
Yu, are you alright?

283
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:04,980
It hurts so bad!

284
00:18:06,519 --> 00:18:07,920
- Bao Zhu!
- Stop her!

285
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:09,759
She's wearing my clothes!

286
00:18:09,759 --> 00:18:11,839
People will laugh at us!

287
00:18:11,839 --> 00:18:14,359
You fought over eggs and skimmed money, fine.

288
00:18:14,359 --> 00:18:16,160
You dare insult your own mother?

289
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:17,400
Are you even human?

290
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:18,880
Have you no shame, you wretch?

291
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:20,079
Me, a wretch?

292
00:18:20,079 --> 00:18:22,039
Then you are the lowest wretch.

293
00:18:22,039 --> 00:18:24,720
Yu hangs at the waist, Zhu sits on the crown!

294
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:27,220
I will always stand above you!

295
00:18:31,279 --> 00:18:32,480
Bao Zhu, you look great!

296
00:18:32,480 --> 00:18:34,640
As long as you work hard with my mother,

297
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:36,619
you'll have it easy after marriage.

298
00:18:38,599 --> 00:18:40,799
Killing harms your karma.

299
00:18:40,799 --> 00:18:44,160
Marry me,
and you can leave this lowly trade behind.

300
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:46,019
Vulgar!

301
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:51,200
Bao Zhu, what's wrong?

302
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:52,279
[Lianhua Village]
If you marry me,

303
00:18:52,279 --> 00:18:54,579
you can just be my pretty wife.

304
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:11,900
Since no one came, let's head back.

305
00:19:18,400 --> 00:19:20,059
Wait!

306
00:19:27,799 --> 00:19:29,299
Wait!

307
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:33,940
Hold on!

308
00:19:35,079 --> 00:19:36,880
You illiterate fool,

309
00:19:36,880 --> 00:19:38,440
don't you know the "Zhu" in your name

310
00:19:38,440 --> 00:19:41,000
means a pig to be slaughtered?

311
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:43,660
Stop!

312
00:20:18,640 --> 00:20:20,140
I, Jin Bao Zhu,

313
00:20:21,039 --> 00:20:22,539
will marry him.

314
00:20:35,520 --> 00:20:41,047
[Xie Manor]

315
00:20:53,424 --> 00:20:55,322
[Zhan Dong Feng, Matriarch of the Xie Family]

316
00:20:55,322 --> 00:20:56,839
[Shen Man Yun, Master Rong Chang's Wife]

317
00:20:56,839 --> 00:20:57,839
[Qin Ke Han, Master Cheng Zong's Concubine]

318
00:20:57,839 --> 00:20:59,339
[Zhou Wan Jun, Madam of the Xie Family,
Master Cheng Zong's Wife]

319
00:21:16,304 --> 00:21:17,304
[Xie Qiao, Fifth Young Master,
Qin Ke Han's Son]

320
00:21:17,304 --> 00:21:18,804
[Xie Xi, Third Young Lady,
Qin Ke Han's Daughter]

321
00:21:26,759 --> 00:21:29,240
M-Matriarch,

322
00:21:29,240 --> 00:21:32,720
Master Yan says he is indisposed today

323
00:21:32,720 --> 00:21:34,279
[Jian Wei, Page of the Xie Family]
and has trouble walking,

324
00:21:34,279 --> 00:21:37,819
so this rooster
will take his place for the bows.

325
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:48,779
Rise.

326
00:21:49,759 --> 00:21:52,440
Poor thing.

327
00:21:52,440 --> 00:21:55,480
What a ridiculous stunt
that unfilial boy pulled,

328
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:58,440
making you endure this fright.

329
00:21:58,440 --> 00:22:00,519
Take some candied fruit and go back.

330
00:22:00,519 --> 00:22:02,059
Thank you, Matriarch.

331
00:22:07,559 --> 00:22:09,460
First bow to Heaven and Earth!

332
00:22:15,680 --> 00:22:17,579
Second bow to the parents!

333
00:22:30,480 --> 00:22:32,500
Bows to each other!

334
00:22:46,079 --> 00:22:49,539
Lady Jin.

335
00:22:51,240 --> 00:22:52,740
Lady Jin.

336
00:23:23,319 --> 00:23:24,559
Lady Jin,

337
00:23:24,559 --> 00:23:27,240
this Beiyuan tea arrived just last month.

338
00:23:27,240 --> 00:23:28,920
It's not the tribute grade.

339
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:31,900
It's for the nobles
to rinse their mouths with.

340
00:23:32,880 --> 00:23:36,779
If you are thirsty,
I'll have someone brew fine tea for you.

341
00:23:37,960 --> 00:23:39,480
That explains it.

342
00:23:39,480 --> 00:23:41,740
Who drinks tea so late at night?

343
00:23:44,880 --> 00:23:47,559
Where is your... my young master?

344
00:23:47,559 --> 00:23:49,440
As for the master's private affairs,

345
00:23:49,440 --> 00:23:53,559
I do not know,
nor would I dare speak out of turn.

346
00:23:53,559 --> 00:23:56,599
Wait, so I'm just supposed
to sit here waiting

347
00:23:56,599 --> 00:23:58,380
on our wedding night?

348
00:24:04,440 --> 00:24:06,579
Understood. You may leave.

349
00:24:16,240 --> 00:24:17,680
Ming Pei,

350
00:24:17,680 --> 00:24:20,200
Master Yan went to Shuyu Pavilion early
for music.

351
00:24:20,200 --> 00:24:22,920
You knew it all along,
so why didn't you tell her?

352
00:24:22,920 --> 00:24:24,880
It's getting windy.

353
00:24:24,880 --> 00:24:27,960
Those who stay perched are falcons,

354
00:24:27,960 --> 00:24:31,299
while those who fall are mere sparrows.

355
00:24:46,720 --> 00:24:49,880
The dancers are quite something today!

356
00:24:49,880 --> 00:24:51,640
- Bottoms up!
- Bottoms up!

357
00:24:51,640 --> 00:24:53,140
Come on.

358
00:24:57,240 --> 00:24:59,079
- Come on!
- Come on, fill it up!

359
00:24:59,079 --> 00:25:02,000
Let's raise a cup to Cheng Jiang!

360
00:25:02,000 --> 00:25:03,500
- Come on!
- Bottoms up!

361
00:25:04,680 --> 00:25:06,692
Drink more.

362
00:25:06,692 --> 00:25:09,039
- Empty the cup!
- Beautiful dancing!

363
00:25:09,039 --> 00:25:11,400
Reward them later!

364
00:25:11,400 --> 00:25:13,519
I don't know what his family was thinking,

365
00:25:13,519 --> 00:25:15,680
forcing him to marry a country bumpkin.

366
00:25:15,680 --> 00:25:19,180
A butcher's daughter must be utterly vulgar.

367
00:25:36,799 --> 00:25:39,859
Who is Xie Yan?

368
00:25:53,880 --> 00:25:57,619
A dressed-up monkey indeed.

369
00:25:58,440 --> 00:25:59,940
What's wrong with a monkey?

370
00:26:04,400 --> 00:26:05,720
[Lu Zi Yu]
He's mocking you.

371
00:26:05,720 --> 00:26:07,740
[Son of Yangzhou Prefecture River Sub-Prefect]
He's calling you an ape in human clothes.

372
00:26:08,799 --> 00:26:11,920
Tell me,
aren't you scared he'll jinx you to death

373
00:26:11,920 --> 00:26:14,019
if you stay with him?

374
00:26:16,559 --> 00:26:20,180
Believe it or not, one cut from me,
and you'll die before me.

375
00:26:22,279 --> 00:26:25,440
Greasy and painted, utterly vulgar.

376
00:26:25,440 --> 00:26:27,880
Rude, arrogant fool,

377
00:26:27,880 --> 00:26:29,500
you bookish pig!

378
00:26:33,279 --> 00:26:35,519
I heard the eldest son of the Xie family

379
00:26:35,519 --> 00:26:39,160
is a jinxed invalid and a paralytic.

380
00:26:39,160 --> 00:26:40,480
Engagement called off,

381
00:26:40,480 --> 00:26:42,960
he had to take a concubine
from the countryside.

382
00:26:42,960 --> 00:26:44,460
Is that right?

383
00:26:47,680 --> 00:26:50,160
Silence means yes.

384
00:26:50,160 --> 00:26:53,000
Alright, are you going back on your own,

385
00:26:53,000 --> 00:26:54,859
or do I have to tie you up?

386
00:27:11,400 --> 00:27:13,759
I wanted to live in peace with you,

387
00:27:13,759 --> 00:27:16,259
but now, I've changed my mind.

388
00:27:21,599 --> 00:27:23,099
Well...

389
00:27:28,920 --> 00:27:30,420
Put me down!

390
00:27:33,359 --> 00:27:34,940
Let me down!

391
00:27:36,000 --> 00:27:37,660
Let me down!

392
00:27:38,599 --> 00:27:40,099
You shrew!

393
00:27:41,559 --> 00:27:43,380
You crazy shrew!

394
00:27:44,519 --> 00:27:46,259
Put me down!

395
00:27:47,079 --> 00:27:48,579
You...

396
00:27:52,432 --> 00:27:55,460
[Virtue and Integrity]

397
00:28:04,640 --> 00:28:07,680
Mother, I heard

398
00:28:07,680 --> 00:28:11,000
that girl is renowned for miles around
for her competence.

399
00:28:11,000 --> 00:28:12,680
She could support Yan.

400
00:28:12,680 --> 00:28:16,960
Besides, pedigree matters little
when taking a concubine,

401
00:28:16,960 --> 00:28:20,200
which is why the Master and I agreed to it.

402
00:28:20,200 --> 00:28:22,259
Yan agreed as well?

403
00:28:23,799 --> 00:28:28,640
Back then,
the Huangs were eager to arrange a betrothal,

404
00:28:28,640 --> 00:28:31,504
and the Master went to great lengths

405
00:28:31,504 --> 00:28:35,119
to convince Yan to accept it.

406
00:28:35,119 --> 00:28:36,619
Later...

407
00:28:39,359 --> 00:28:44,240
Later, that terrible accident happened,

408
00:28:44,240 --> 00:28:47,279
and they rushed to break off the match.

409
00:28:47,279 --> 00:28:50,960
Not only that,
they spread rumors all over town,

410
00:28:50,960 --> 00:28:53,559
leaving everyone whispering behind our backs

411
00:28:53,559 --> 00:28:57,440
that Yan is a sickly jinx who curses wives,

412
00:28:57,440 --> 00:28:59,839
forcing us to cancel the betrothal.

413
00:28:59,839 --> 00:29:03,720
None of us could swallow that insult,

414
00:29:03,720 --> 00:29:05,519
let alone Yan.

415
00:29:05,519 --> 00:29:08,680
So Yan doesn't care for her,

416
00:29:08,680 --> 00:29:12,819
and only agreed to spite them?

417
00:29:13,960 --> 00:29:15,400
How foolish!

418
00:29:15,400 --> 00:29:19,359
Saving face is not about a moment,
but a lifetime.

419
00:29:19,359 --> 00:29:23,180
Don't you understand
that harmony in the family brings prosperity?

420
00:29:25,720 --> 00:29:28,079
You are right, Mother.

421
00:29:28,079 --> 00:29:30,880
In my rush to vindicate our pride,

422
00:29:30,880 --> 00:29:32,559
I wronged Yan.

423
00:29:32,559 --> 00:29:33,839
It was all my fault.

424
00:29:33,839 --> 00:29:35,680
You arranged a mismatched marriage,

425
00:29:35,680 --> 00:29:38,079
wronging the children of both families,

426
00:29:38,079 --> 00:29:40,299
not just Yan.

427
00:29:44,240 --> 00:29:46,519
Matriarch, Madam,

428
00:29:46,519 --> 00:29:49,500
Lady Jin carried Master Yan all the way back

429
00:29:50,519 --> 00:29:53,660
from Shuyu Pavilion on... on her shoulders.

430
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:57,460
Carried him on her shoulders?

431
00:30:04,440 --> 00:30:05,480
Bring her here.

432
00:30:05,480 --> 00:30:06,980
I'm not deaf.

433
00:30:09,240 --> 00:30:11,940
Why glare at me? Do I owe you money?

434
00:30:13,519 --> 00:30:14,880
Come here and sign.

435
00:30:14,880 --> 00:30:16,784
Sign what?

436
00:30:16,784 --> 00:30:18,000
[Concubine Release Deed]

437
00:30:18,000 --> 00:30:19,500
Concubine Release Deed.

438
00:30:21,079 --> 00:30:22,880
I can't read or write.

439
00:30:22,880 --> 00:30:25,119
Vulgar and unrefined,

440
00:30:25,119 --> 00:30:27,200
bent only on social climbing,

441
00:30:27,200 --> 00:30:29,420
so naturally, no time for books.

442
00:30:33,519 --> 00:30:35,019
Right, Jian Wei?

443
00:30:41,200 --> 00:30:42,900
I can sign.

444
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:47,339
Just have everyone else step outside.

445
00:30:55,759 --> 00:30:57,259
Just a signature...

446
00:31:14,279 --> 00:31:16,000
You dared slap me?

447
00:31:16,000 --> 00:31:17,779
Yes, I did!
